1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,288
Straw hat… red string…

2
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:05,268
Don't push Brother…

3
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:06,173
Push Brother?

4
00:00:06,437 --> 00:00:07,342
Who pushed?

5
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:08,243
Medicine's ready!

6
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:09,669
The fever's too high,

7
00:00:10,014 --> 00:00:11,206
it's not working.

8
00:00:11,552 --> 00:00:13,253
No doctor in the village.

9
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:14,848
The town's under curfew,

10
00:00:14,938 --> 00:00:16,902
the gates stay shut.

11
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:17,993
An hour's ride,

12
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:19,709
she can't wait.

13
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:23,007
Urgent mission:

14
00:00:23,358 --> 00:00:27,064
break Xiaohe's fever by dawn.

15
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:30,326
Give me the horse.

16
00:00:30,395 --> 00:00:31,097
I trust you.

17
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:34,739
A-Ling can ride?!

18
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:36,943
That's a cavalry mount.

19
00:00:37,011 --> 00:00:38,607
Who is she, really?

20
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,103
East Street, Doctor Bai!

21
00:00:50,055 --> 00:00:50,722
Curfew!

22
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:52,291
Bandits about, turn back!

23
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,128
Women don't ride horses!

24
00:00:54,203 --> 00:00:54,910
Move.

25
00:00:55,403 --> 00:00:57,244
One more step and we take you!

26
00:01:02,077 --> 00:01:02,805
Crossbows!

27
00:01:02,857 --> 00:01:03,700
After her!

28
00:01:05,531 --> 00:01:06,726
Brother…

29
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:08,864
She drank it!

30
00:01:09,257 --> 00:01:09,744
I'm here.

31
00:01:09,802 --> 00:01:11,300
Hold on till A-Ling's back.

32
00:01:13,457 --> 00:01:14,261
Doctor Bai!

33
00:01:14,333 --> 00:01:15,187
Open up!

34
00:01:15,262 --> 00:01:16,975
Coming, coming,

35
00:01:18,819 --> 00:01:20,194
quit that banging.

36
00:01:22,486 --> 00:01:23,041
Freeze!

37
00:01:27,686 --> 00:01:28,925
Crossbows, aim at her.

38
00:01:31,852 --> 00:01:32,285
Loose—
